accumulate "/home/jfs/mmt/content/MathHub/MMT/LATIN2/export/lf-elpi/content/latin..NONE/$Simple$Functions".

/* generated from eta : {A,B,F:tm (simpfun A B)}ded (equal (simpfun A B) (simplambda A B [x]simpapply A B F x) F) */

ded X1 (equal (simpfun A B) (simplambda A B x \ simpapply A B F x) F) :- help/eta A B F X1.

help/eta A B F (prodcert X1/1 X1/2) :- help/eta A B F X1/1 , help/eta A B F X1/2.

help/eta A B F (idcert X2) :- X2 > 0 , X1 is X2 - 1.

help/eta A B F (ptcert (eta A B F)).

